{"id":"f61f3b903d59acda","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-seq-diagonal-sequence.md","title":"ZFC Seq Diagonal Sequence","display":"df-zfc-seq-diagonal-sequence — ZFC Seq Diagonal Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-seq-diagonal-sequence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-seq-diagonal-sequence"],"display":"df-zfc-seq-diagonal-sequence — ZFC Seq Diagonal Sequence","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-seq-enumeration-sequence.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-seq-diagonal-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-seq-diagonal-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-seq-diagonal-sequence — ZFC Seq Diagonal Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7cd9f34a9effddc2\" href=\"?note=7cd9f34a9effddc2\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-seq-enumeration-sequence.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-seq-enumeration-sequence.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d490b03448142d4c\" href=\"?note=d490b03448142d4c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> (two-argument sequence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7cd9f34a9effddc2\" href=\"?note=7cd9f34a9effddc2\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-seq-enumeration-sequence.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-seq-enumeration-sequence.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> (omega sequence) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (common codomain)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqEnumerationSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqEnumerationSequence}_S\\)</span> (enumeration-sequence predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\\)</span> (omega-sequence predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqDiagonalSequenceStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqDiagonalSequenceStructure}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqDiagonalSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqDiagonalSequence}_S\\)</span> (explicit predicate and compatibility projection)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSeqDiagonalSequenceStructure}_S(d,s,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcSeqEnumerationSequence}_S(s,A,\\omega\\times\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(d,A)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(d(n)=s(\\langle n,n\\rangle))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSeqDiagonalSequenceStructure}_S(d,s,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcSeqEnumerationSequence}_S(s,A,\\omega\\times\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(d,A)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(d(n)=s(\\langle n,n\\rangle))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSeqDiagonalSequence}_S(d,s)\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSeqDiagonalSequenceStructure}_S(d,s,A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSeqDiagonalSequence}_S(d,s)\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSeqDiagonalSequenceStructure}_S(d,s,A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both sequences share one explicit codomain, and the two-dimensional input is the ordered pair <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle n,n\\rangle\">\\(\\langle n,n\\rangle\\)</span> required by the upstream set-coded function convention.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-seq-enumeration-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"7cd9f34a9effddc2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-seq-enumeration-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"d490b03448142d4c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-seq-enumeration-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"7cd9f34a9effddc2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s$ (two-argument sequence, see [[../batch13/58-df-zfc-seq-enumeration-sequence.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqEnumerationSequence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqDiagonalSequenceStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqDiagonalSequence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSeqDiagonalSequenceStructure}_S(d,s,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcSeqEnumerationSequence}_S(s,A,\\omega\\times\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(d,A)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(d(n)=s(\\langle n,n\\rangle))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSeqDiagonalSequence}_S(d,s)\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSeqDiagonalSequenceStructure}_S(d,s,A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle n,n\\rangle","display":false}],"bytes":1579,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3345","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-seq-diagonal-sequence.md|58-df-zfc-seq-diagonal-sequence]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","7cd9f34a9effddc2","d490b03448142d4c"]}